{
    "chapter_num": 8,
    "verses_count": 27,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Vision of a Ram and a Goat"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The Hebrew language resumes in Dan. 8:1."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the third year of the reign of King Belshazzar a vision appeared "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " me—to me, Daniel—after the one that appeared to me the first time. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I saw in the vision, and it so happened while I was looking, that I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in Shushan,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Susa"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or fortified palace"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "citadel, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the province of Elam; and I saw in the vision that I was by the River Ulai. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then I lifted my eyes and saw, and there, standing beside the river, was a ram which had two horns, and the two horns "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " high; but one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " higher than the other, and the higher "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came up last. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I saw the ram pushing westward, northward, and southward, so that no animal could "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. stand before him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "withstand him; nor "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was there any"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that could deliver from his hand, but he did according to his will and became great."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And as I was considering, suddenly a male goat came from the west, across the surface of the whole earth, without touching the ground; and the goat "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "had"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a notable horn between his eyes. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he came to the ram that had two horns, which I had seen standing beside the river, and ran at him with furious power. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I saw him confronting the ram; he was moved with rage against him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. struck"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "attacked the ram, and broke his two horns. There was no power in the ram to withstand him, but he cast him down to the ground and trampled him; and there was no one that could deliver the ram from his hand."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore the male goat grew very great; but when he became strong, the large horn was broken, and in place of it four notable ones came up toward the four winds of heaven. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And out of one of them came a little horn which grew exceedingly great toward the south, toward the east, and toward the Glorious "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Land."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And it grew up to the host of heaven; and it cast down "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the host and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the stars to the ground, and trampled them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He even exalted "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "himself"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as high as the Prince of the host; and by him the daily "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "sacrifices"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " were taken away, and the place of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The temple"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "His sanctuary was cast down. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Because of transgression, an army was given over "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to the horn"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to oppose the daily "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "sacrifices;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and he cast truth down to the ground. He did "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "all this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and prospered."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then I heard a holy one speaking; and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "another"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " holy one said to that certain "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " who was speaking, “How long "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "will"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the vision "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be, concerning"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the daily "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "sacrifices"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and the transgression "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or making desolate"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of desolation, the giving of both the sanctuary and the host to be trampled underfoot?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said to me, “For two thousand three hundred "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. evening-mornings"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "days; then the sanctuary shall be cleansed.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Gabriel Interprets the Vision"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then it happened, when I, Daniel, had seen the vision and was seeking the meaning, that suddenly there stood before me one having the appearance of a man. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I heard a man’s voice between "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the banks of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the Ulai, who called, and said, “Gabriel, make this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "man"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " understand the vision.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he came near where I stood, and when he came I was afraid and fell on my face; but he said to me, “Understand, son of man, that the vision "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "refers"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the time of the end.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now, as he was speaking with me, I was in a deep sleep with my face to the ground; but he touched me, and stood me upright. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said, “Look, I am making known to you what shall happen in the latter time of the indignation; for at the appointed time the end "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The ram which you saw, having the two horns—"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "they are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the kings of Media and Persia. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "shaggy male"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "male goat "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. king, representing his kingdom, Dan. 7:17, 23"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "kingdom of Greece. The large horn that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " between its eyes "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the first king. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As for the broken "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "horn"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and the four that stood up in its place, four kingdoms shall arise out of that nation, but not with its power."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“And in the latter time of their kingdom,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When the transgressors have reached their fullness,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "A king shall arise,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Having fierce "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. countenance"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "features,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Who understands sinister schemes."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "His power shall be mighty, but not by his own power;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He shall destroy "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or extraordinarily"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fearfully,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And shall prosper and thrive;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He shall destroy the mighty, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "also"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the holy people."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Through his cunning"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He shall cause deceit to prosper under his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. hand"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "rule;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he shall exalt "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "himself"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in his heart."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He shall destroy many in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " prosperity."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He shall even rise against the Prince of princes;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But he shall be broken without "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "human"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. hand"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "means."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“And the vision of the evenings and mornings"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Which was told is true;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore seal up the vision,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it refers"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to many days "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in the future."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I, Daniel, fainted and was sick for days; afterward I arose and went about the king’s business. I was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "amazed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "astonished by the vision, but no one understood it."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}